<title>UK: KB International sets $75 mln 4-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>KB International sets $75 mln 4-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KB INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK (RATED AA+/AA)</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON    *5.0 PCT   MATURITY    13.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.978   PAY DATE    13.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    100.578   SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA+	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> FORCE MAJ  YES	 GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.225</p>
<p> SELL CONC  1.40	UNDERLYING GOVT BOND AUG 1999 U.S.TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR TWO YEARS, 8.375 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
